OL,3,GNEWSAThe charity building young
OL,4,Apeople's confidence
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlivia is among the children and young
OL,7,Fadults with special educational needs
OL,8,Fand disabilities who have found support
OL,9,Fthrough the charity, which has been
OL,10,Fhelped by funding from BBC Children in
OL,11,FNeed.
